cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Turnkey in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Turnkey: Bring Your Own Detector"
abstract: >-
  A development and debugging harness for jailbreak detectors, guards, and
  model-side safety policies: paired reference/intervention evaluation, typed
  model signals (logprobs, hidden states, gradients), inspectable event
  traces, and reproducible audit artifacts.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Junnan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lijrjyan/turnkey"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-22"
keywords:
  - jailbreak-detection
  - llm-safety
  - guardrails
  - evaluation-harness
